<meta name="description" content="A Month-Long Display of German-Style Christmas Lights November 20 &#8211; December 25, 2026 The market has been held in Sapporo since 2002, when the city marked the thirtieth anniversary of its sister-city ties with Munich, Germany. Stalls selling Christmas items, hot wine, and German food are set up for about a month at&nbsp;Odori Park. Also...">
