      <section class="section-detail">
        <article class="section-detail_article">
          <div class="section-detail_head">
            <h1 class="title-detail">German Christmas Market in Sapporo</h1>
            <div class="section-detail_head_tag"><ul class="list-cat is-pc-center"><li class="list-cat_item"><a class="list-cat_tag" href="https://www.sapporo.travel/en/event/event-list/?cgnr[]=event&cspt[]=sc12-drink">Alcohol</a></li><li class="list-cat_item"><a class="list-cat_tag" href="https://www.sapporo.travel/en/event/event-list/?cgnr[]=event&cspt[]=sc09-recreational">Experience</a></li><li class="list-cat_item"><a class="list-cat_tag" href="https://www.sapporo.travel/en/event/event-list/?cgnr[]=event&cspt[]=sc03-culture">Culture</a></li><li class="list-cat_item"><a class="list-cat_tag" href="https://www.sapporo.travel/en/event/event-list/?cgnr[]=event&care[]=a01-chuo">Chuo-ku</a></li><li class="list-cat_item"><a class="list-cat_tag" href="https://www.sapporo.travel/en/event/event-list/?cgnr[]=event&cssn[]=m-11">November</a></li><li class="list-cat_item"><span class="list-cat_tag is-round"></span></li></ul></div>          </div>
          <div class="section-detail_content styling-post">
            
<h4>A Month-Long Display of German-Style Christmas Lights</h4>



<p>November 20 &#8211; December 25, 2026</p>



<p>The market has been held in Sapporo since 2002, when the city marked the thirtieth anniversary of its sister-city ties with Munich, Germany. Stalls selling Christmas items, hot wine, and German food are set up for about a month at&nbsp;<a href="https://www.sapporo.travel/find/nature-and-parks/odori_park/?lang=en">Odori Park</a>. Also on sale are commemorative mug cups which change design each year. There are outdoor concerts, indoor workshops, and if you’re lucky you might receive a gift from Santa Claus! Tents with seats are available near the food stalls, so you don’t have to worry about the snow. The Christmas mood deepens from late November, when the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.sapporo.travel/event/event/winter/sapporo_white_illumination/?lang=en">Sapporo White Illumination</a>&nbsp;also begins at Odori Park.</p>



<p></p>



<figure class="wp-block-table is-style-stripes"><table><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://www.sapporo.travel/blog/english/munich-christmas-market-and-sapporo-tv-tower/">Munich Christmas Market and Sapporo TV Tower</a>&nbsp;| Welcome to Sapporo Blog</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>



<p></p>



